1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:10,589
This is the Good Together Assessment Three presentation prepared for Lu Yu, student number 24832520.
这是鲁彧的 Good Together 第三次作业讲解，学号为 24832520。

2
00:00:10,809 --> 00:00:17,718
My presentation focuses on the database, the API, data consistency, and deployment.
我的讲解重点是数据库、接口、数据一致性和部署。

3
00:00:17,938 --> 00:00:25,762
These topics correspond to the schema, backend, startup, and hosting changes recorded under my project account.
这些主题对应项目账户下记录的数据库结构、后端、启动入口和部署提交。

4
00:00:25,982 --> 00:00:34,407
The application connects a public charity event website and a separate staff website to the same Express server and MySQL database.
应用把公开的慈善活动网站和独立的管理网站，连接到同一个 Express 服务和 MySQL 数据库。

5
00:00:34,627 --> 00:00:43,977
I will connect the implementation to the visible search, registration, and management workflows, then show the verified SCU deployment.
接下来我会结合搜索、报名和后台管理流程解释实现方式，再展示已验证的 SCU 部署。

6
00:00:44,197 --> 00:00:49,327
The demonstration uses fictional attendees and does not process online payments.
演示使用虚构的报名者信息，不处理在线支付。

7
00:00:50,283 --> 00:00:57,364
The schema has four tables: organisations, categories, events, and registrations.
数据库包含四张表：组织、分类、活动和报名。

8
00:00:57,584 --> 00:01:06,027
An organisation can host many events, a category can classify many events, and each registration belongs to one event.
一个组织可以举办多个活动，一个分类可以关联多个活动，每条报名记录只属于一个活动。

9
00:01:06,247 --> 00:01:14,814
The registration table stores contact details, ticket quantity, the booking time, and a snapshot of the unit price.
报名表保存联系方式、票数、报名时间，以及报名时的单价快照。

10
00:01:15,034 --> 00:01:22,486
The combined event and email key prevents duplicate bookings for one event while allowing the same person to join another event.
活动编号和邮箱组成的联合唯一键，防止同一活动重复报名，同时允许同一人参加其他活动。

11
00:01:22,706 --> 00:01:31,273
The restricted foreign key prevents deletion of an event that still has registrations; database triggers also enforce valid values.
限制删除的外键防止删除已有报名的活动，数据库触发器还会检查数值是否合法。

12
00:01:31,493 --> 00:01:42,739
The initial dataset contains two organisations, six categories, twelve events, and twelve registrations, including past and suspended examples.
初始数据包含两个组织、六个分类、十二个活动和十二条报名，并包含已结束及暂停发布的示例。

13
00:01:43,749 --> 00:01:50,690
The public event endpoint returns active events that have not ended, sorted by their start time and identifier.
公开活动接口返回尚未结束且正常发布的活动，并按开始时间和编号排序。

14
00:01:50,910 --> 00:01:58,398
Search accepts a start date, a suburb, and a category; supplied filters are combined with AND conditions.
搜索支持开始日期、地区和分类，提交的筛选条件通过 AND 组合。

15
00:01:58,618 --> 00:02:05,460
For example, Southport and the Fun run category produce the matching coastal run in the deployed website.
例如，在已部署的网站中选择 Southport 和趣味跑分类，会得到对应的海岸跑步活动。

16
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:14,535
The API validates the query first, then passes user values separately from the SQL statement through parameter placeholders.
接口先验证查询参数，再通过参数占位符把用户输入与 SQL 语句分开传入。

17
00:02:14,755 --> 00:02:23,658
The location filter also escapes wildcard characters, so a literal search term is not accidentally treated as a wildcard pattern.
地区筛选还会转义通配符，避免把用户输入误当作通配模式。

18
00:02:23,878 --> 00:02:31,044
Invalid identifiers or dates return a validation error, while a valid search without matches returns an empty list.
非法编号或日期会返回验证错误，合法但没有匹配结果的搜索则返回空列表。

19
00:02:32,015 --> 00:02:39,258
The registration endpoint validates the event identifier and request body before starting a database transaction.
报名接口先验证活动编号和请求内容，然后开启数据库事务。

20
00:02:39,478 --> 00:02:45,320
It selects the event row with FOR UPDATE, then checks that the event is active and has not ended.
它使用 FOR UPDATE 锁定活动行，再检查活动是否正常发布且尚未结束。

21
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:54,211
The server reads the ticket price from that locked row and generates the registration time itself; it never trusts a price sent by the browser.
服务端从被锁定的活动行读取票价，并自行生成报名时间，不信任浏览器传来的价格。

22
00:02:54,431 --> 00:03:02,990
Updating and deleting an event use the same row lock, which coordinates bookings with price changes, suspension, and deletion.
活动修改和删除使用同一行锁，使报名与改价、暂停发布和删除操作保持一致。

23
00:03:03,210 --> 00:03:12,199
A successful transaction returns the saved record with status 201, and any failure rolls back before the connection is released.
事务成功后返回保存的记录和 201 状态码，失败时先回滚，再释放数据库连接。

24
00:03:12,419 --> 00:03:19,520
The unique key remains the final duplicate safeguard even if two matching requests arrive at almost the same time.
即使两个相同的请求几乎同时到达，唯一键仍是阻止重复报名的最终保障。

25
00:03:20,481 --> 00:03:28,204
In the browser, the search form creates URL parameters and calls the shared JSON request helper with fetch.
在浏览器中，搜索表单生成网址参数，再通过共享的 JSON 请求函数调用 fetch。

26
00:03:28,424 --> 00:03:34,553
The server returns a data array, and renderEvents creates the visible event cards from that array.
服务端返回 data 数组，renderEvents 根据数组生成可见的活动卡片。

27
00:03:34,773 --> 00:03:44,608
Database text is assigned with textContent rather than inserted as executable HTML, and event images are restricted to local asset paths.
数据库文本通过 textContent 写入，而不是作为可执行的 HTML 插入，活动图片也限制为本地资源路径。

28
00:03:44,828 --> 00:03:53,397
During a request, the page shows loading feedback; failures produce an error and retry action instead of a silent blank result.
请求期间页面显示加载状态，失败时给出错误和重试操作，避免只留下空白结果。

29
00:03:53,617 --> 00:04:03,186
Registration uses the same pattern in reverse: the form sends JSON, then displays the identifier and total returned by the server.
报名使用相反方向的数据流：表单发送 JSON，再显示服务端返回的编号和总金额。

30
00:04:03,406 --> 00:04:12,928
Refreshing the event page retrieves the stored registration again, demonstrating database persistence rather than a temporary browser-only change.
刷新活动页面后会重新取得已保存的报名，这证明数据存在数据库中，而不是浏览器里的临时变化。

31
00:04:13,881 --> 00:04:21,380
The staff event list includes active, past, and suspended records, unlike the public discovery list.
管理端活动列表包含正常发布、已结束和暂停发布的记录，与公开列表的范围不同。

32
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:30,184
Creating an event uses POST, editing uses PUT, and deletion uses DELETE, with server validation applied to every write.
创建活动使用 POST，修改使用 PUT，删除使用 DELETE，每次写入都经过服务端验证。

33
00:04:30,404 --> 00:04:39,238
The recorded workflow creates a temporary event, saves a suspension change, and deletes the unused record after confirmation.
录制的操作流程创建一个临时活动，保存暂停发布的修改，再经确认删除没有报名的记录。

34
00:04:39,458 --> 00:04:47,760
When an event already has registrations, deletion returns a conflict and the interface explains that it can be suspended instead.
当活动已有报名时，删除会返回冲突，界面提示可以改为暂停发布。

35
00:04:47,980 --> 00:04:55,857
Category deletion is similarly restricted when an event still references that category, preserving the database relationships.
当活动仍引用某个分类时，该分类同样不能删除，以保护数据库关系。

36
00:04:56,077 --> 00:05:05,027
The public registration list omits email and phone; the staff view includes them, but this teaching version has no staff authentication.
公开报名列表不显示邮箱和电话，管理端会显示这些信息，但此教学版本没有管理端身份验证。

37
00:05:06,014 --> 00:05:12,849
The optional weather service requests a forecast from Open Meteo using the event coordinates and Brisbane time.
可选的天气服务根据活动坐标和布里斯班时区，向 Open Meteo 请求预报。

38
00:05:13,069 --> 00:05:22,463
It uses a timeout and cache, and gives a clear fallback for missing coordinates, network failures, or dates outside the forecast window.
它设置了超时和缓存，并在缺少坐标、网络失败或日期超出预报范围时给出清晰说明。

39
00:05:22,683 --> 00:05:33,747
Seventy-one backend tests passed locally, including duplicate submissions, protected deletion, concurrent operations, and database constraints.
本地通过了七十一项后端测试，覆盖重复报名、受保护的删除、并发操作和数据库约束。

40
00:05:33,967 --> 00:05:41,719
Forty-six browser checks passed with Chromium and WebKit, including mobile, tablet, and desktop layouts.
Chromium 和 WebKit 中通过了四十六项浏览器检查，包含手机、平板和桌面布局。

41
00:05:41,939 --> 00:05:49,205
The local backend suite also passed on Node eighteen point twenty point eight, matching the runtime supplied by SCU.
本地后端测试也在 Node 十八点二十点八版本通过，与 SCU 提供的运行环境一致。

42
00:05:49,425 --> 00:05:57,597
These logs document specific checks and dates; they are not a guarantee that every possible production scenario has been tested.
这些日志记录了具体检查及日期，并不表示已经测试了所有可能的生产场景。

43
00:05:58,547 --> 00:06:05,352
My SCU destination uses the domain shown here, with the staff website available at the admin path.
我的 SCU 部署地址显示在画面上，管理网站位于 admin 路径。

44
00:06:05,572 --> 00:06:13,047
The private application starts through app dot J S in Passenger production mode and uses a dedicated MySQL database.
应用位于私有目录，通过 app.js 在 Passenger 生产模式下启动，并使用专用 MySQL 数据库。

45
00:06:13,267 --> 00:06:23,660
Database credentials stay only on the host; configuration files, SQL, and dependencies are not exposed as public website files.
数据库凭据只保存在主机中，配置文件、SQL 和依赖不会作为网站文件公开。

46
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:34,609
On eleven October, this site passed fourteen HTTPS checks and nine external browser checks, including a real fictional registration and refresh.
十月十一日，该站点通过十四项 HTTPS 检查和九项外部浏览器检查，包括使用虚构信息实际报名并刷新确认。

47
00:06:34,829 --> 00:06:43,423
All forty deployed source checksums matched, and temporary verification records were removed while the original seed records were preserved.
四十个部署文件的校验值全部匹配，临时验收记录已经清理，原始示例数据得到保留。

48
00:06:43,643 --> 00:06:53,290
The main design decision is to keep integrity in the database and API, while the browser provides a clear, responsive explanation of each result.
核心设计是由数据库和接口保证数据完整性，再由浏览器清晰、及时地展示每一步结果。
